---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import GoogleBusinessInfo from '../../components/GoogleBusinessInfo.astro';

const title = 'Mason City Drain Cleaning | A-1 Drain Cleaning';
const description = 'Mason City drain cleaning for clogged drains, main drain backups, floor drains and sewer lines. A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City. Call 641-530-2728.';
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} path="/mason-city-drain-cleaning/">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-[#1A1A68] text-white">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 py-14 sm:py-18 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:items-center lg:py-20">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-300">A-1 Drain Cleaning • Mason City, Iowa</p>
          <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[.98] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Mason City Drain Cleaning</h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City and clears clogged drains, main drains, floor drains, and sewer lines for local homes and businesses.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate-200">If one sink is slow, several fixtures are backing up, or wastewater is coming up through a floor drain, tell us what the water is doing. That pattern helps identify where to start.</p>
          <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-7 py-4 text-center text-lg font-black text-white hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
          <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">24/7 drain and sewer service • Mason City and surrounding North Iowa</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="border border-white/15 bg-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8" aria-labelledby="mason-city-problem">
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-red-200">Start with the symptom</p>
          <h2 id="mason-city-problem" class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight">What is the drain doing?</h2>
          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-slate-200">
            <li class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4"><strong class="text-white">One sink, tub, or shower:</strong> slow or completely stopped.</li>
            <li class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4"><strong class="text-white">Several fixtures:</strong> more than one drain backs up or gurgles.</li>
            <li class="border-b border-white/10 pb-4"><strong class="text-white">Basement floor drain:</strong> wastewater rises when water is used elsewhere.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Laundry:</strong> washer discharge comes back through a standpipe or floor drain.</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-18" aria-labelledby="mason-city-answers">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Mason City drain problems</p>
        <h2 id="mason-city-answers" class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">What kind of drain problem do you have?</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">A single slow fixture can have a blockage close to that fixture. When several fixtures are affected, a toilet flush makes another drain rise, or wastewater comes up through the lowest drain, the restriction may be farther down a shared line or the main sewer.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Main drain backup</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">If toilets, sinks, tubs, or floor drains are affected together, the problem may be in the main drain or a shared line.</p>
            <a href="/services/main-drain-cleaning/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Main drain cleaning →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Basement floor drain backup</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">A basement floor drain is often one of the lowest openings in the house. Wastewater there can be a sign of a downstream restriction.</p>
            <a href="/services/basement-floor-drains/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Basement floor drains →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Sewer line blockage</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Repeated backups or a blockage farther down the sewer line can affect several fixtures at once.</p>
            <a href="/services/sewer-line-cleaning/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Sewer line cleaning →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Kitchen and bathroom drains</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Slow or stopped sinks, tubs, and showers can have a blockage in the fixture drain or a nearby branch line.</p>
            <a href="/services/kitchen-bathroom-drains/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Kitchen &amp; bathroom drains →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Laundry drain backup</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">A washing machine pumps out quickly. A restricted laundry or shared drain can cause water to rise when the washer empties.</p>
            <a href="/services/laundry-drains/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Laundry drains →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Tree roots in sewer lines</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Roots entering a sewer line can contribute to recurring blockages. Tell us if the same line keeps stopping up.</p>
            <a href="/services/tree-roots-in-sewer-line/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Tree roots in sewer lines →</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-100 py-14 sm:py-18" aria-labelledby="mason-city-quick-answers">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Quick answers</p>
        <h2 id="mason-city-quick-answers" class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Mason City drain cleaning questions</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
          <article class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">How do I know if my main drain is blocked?</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">Several fixtures backing up together, wastewater coming up through a basement floor drain, or one fixture causing another to rise can point to a restriction farther down the drain system. Those symptoms are clues, not a diagnosis.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">What should I do if sewage comes up through a floor drain?</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">Stop using toilets, sinks, showers, and the washing machine as much as practical. Keep children and pets away from wastewater. Call A-1 Drain Cleaning at <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">641-530-2728</a> and explain which fixtures were being used when the backup happened.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Why does my washing machine make a floor drain back up?</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">A washer releases a large amount of water quickly. If the laundry drain or a shared line cannot carry that flow away, water can rise in the standpipe or come through a nearby floor drain.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Can a sewer backup happen in a house without a basement?</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">Yes. In a home without a basement floor drain, a blocked main line may show up in a bathtub or shower. Tell us which fixture backed up first and whether other drains are affected.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950">Do you provide 24/7 drain cleaning in Mason City?</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning offers 24/7 drain and sewer service. Call <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">641-530-2728</a> and explain the blockage or backup.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-18" aria-labelledby="mason-city-local">
      <div class="container grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] lg:items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Local service</p>
          <h2 id="mason-city-local" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Based in Mason City</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl leading-7 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based at 206 29th St SW, Mason City, Iowa 50401. Mason City is the home base for service in the surrounding North Iowa communities.</p>
          <address class="mt-5 not-italic font-bold text-slate-950">206 29th St SW<br />Mason City, IA 50401</address>
          <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-6 py-3 font-black text-white hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <a href="/service-area/clear-lake/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Clear Lake</a>
          <a href="/service-area/forest-city/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Forest City</a>
          <a href="/service-area/charles-city/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Charles City</a>
          <a href="/service-area/nora-springs/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Nora Springs</a>
          <a href="/service-area/garner/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Garner</a>
          <a href="/service-area/northwood/" class="border border-slate-200 p-4 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Northwood</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ContactCTA showForm />
    <GoogleBusinessInfo />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</MainLayout>
